{"id":2322,"title":{"romaji":"Psycho-Pass: Sinners of the System Case.3 - Onshuu no Kanata ni","english":"PSYCHO-PASS Sinners of the System: Case.3 Beyond the Pale of Vengeance","native":"PSYCHO-PASS サイコパス Sinners of the System Case.3 - 恩讐の彼方に____"},"slug":"psycho_pass_sinners_of_the_system_case3_onshuu_no_kanata_ni","synopsis":"\"Would you become my teacher?\"\n\n\nFollowing the incident in the Southeast Asia Union (SEAUn) in 2116, Shinya Kogami resumes his vagrant journey. In a small South Asian nation, Kogami rescues a bus of refugees under attack by armed guerrilla forces. Among the refugees is a young lady by the name of Tenzing, who begs Kogami to teach her how to retaliate against the enemy. Just what do the girl who wishes for revenge and the man who has exacted revenge see as they gaze upon the edge of a world from which there is no escape?\n\n\n(Source: Official Website, translated by Edo)","format":"MOVIE","season":"WINTER","year":2019,"createdAt":"2021-03-27 00:44:27","updatedAt":"2021-03-28 06:40:39","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":37442},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":104990},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":41029},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":13894},{"site":"ANN","externalId":21547},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":9809},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"CRUNCHYROLL","externalId":null},{"site":"X","externalId":null}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":4635,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/v2rHxspMqOtQOzU469379aUSJHqLDu937oFjvBIg.jpg"},{"id":4636,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/1QGo8mhHHgBQUG7770lxLILmmxWYOZqYWFLNvHCe.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":65,"name":"Production I.G","slug":"production_ig"}]},"series":{"nodes":[{"id":134,"name":"Psycho Pass","slug":"psycho_pass"}]},"animethemes":[{"id":9351,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":9352,"title":{"romaji":"Abnormalize (Remixed by Masayuki Nakano)","native":null}},"animethemeentries":[{"id":10989,"version":1,"episodes":null,"